---
Add LED-style level meters to mixer view.

Show per-track and master output level meters with segmented LED
appearance (green/yellow/red).

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Per-track level meters in mixer view
- [ ] Master output level meter
- [ ] Segmented LED appearance (8-12 segments)
- [ ] Green for low levels, yellow for medium, red for clipping
- [ ] Peak hold indicator (brief hold at peak, then decay)
- [ ] Meters driven by actual audio levels (RMS or peak)

## Test Plan
- [ ] Play audio, verify meters respond to level
- [ ] Verify clipping shows red segment
- [ ] Verify meters decay when audio stops
- [ ] Verify per-track meters independent from each other
